- Rewrote `flush()` to return a delivery record (`{sink: "otlp", batch_id, event_count, status, http_status, reason_code}`) or `None` for an empty batch — matching the Loki contract so `agent_stream` (T042) can persist local `telemetry_delivery` evidence. `_post` now reports per-signal outcome instead of silently swallowing it; the batch is marked `failed` on any HTTP non-2xx or transport error.

**Verification:** `python3 -m pytest -q lib/test_ralph_otel_ship.py` → 19 passed (the 7 previously-failing T037 prime tests now pass, existing tests unchanged); `py_compile` clean. Flipped T041's checkbox to `[x]`.

